            <ArticleTitle>Coronary CT angiography for chest pain in pseudoxanthoma elasticum and cardiac intervention management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>238-41</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.jcct.2015.02.004</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S1934-5925(15)00058-1</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe the case of a rare cause of severe coronary artery disease in a young woman without cardiovascular risk factors. Cardiac CT played an important role in diagnosis and cardiac management including coronary intervention.</AbstractText>
